/*
 * Return a new Decimal whose value is the arccosine (inverse cosine) in radians of the value of
 * this Decimal.
 *
 * Domain: [-1, 1]
 * Range: [0, pi]
 *
 * acos(x) = pi/2 - asin(x)
 *
 * acos(0)       = pi/2
 * acos(-0)      = pi/2
 * acos(1)       = 0
 * acos(-1)      = pi
 * acos(1/2)     = pi/3
 * acos(-1/2)    = 2*pi/3
 * acos(|x| > 1) = NaN
 * acos(NaN)     = NaN
 *
 */
